# Nucleo outline-duo defaults

When inserting or copying Nucleo **ui** `outline-duo` icons into this project:

- Set the component's default `duoOpacity` to `0.2` (Nucleo's packaged default is `0.3`).
- Also pass `duoOpacity={0.2}` at the call site so the project default is explicit.

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD
<GridLayout5OutlineDuo18 duoOpacity={0.2} />

// ❌ BAD — Nucleo's packaged 0.3 default with no override
<GridLayout5OutlineDuo18 />
```

This does not apply to `glyph-duo` (keep Nucleo's default unless asked).
